Z||000000||FieroMaster88||08-07-2001||10:54 PM||||This is my car after 2 weeks of "boredom"!  Took a week vacation and installed the 2.8L and a 5 speed isuzu trans.  Also added the spoiler.  I have some plans for it when I store it over the winter, and I cant wait!<P>I would like to thank The Fieromaster for the engine and the help installing it (we had a cherry picker, 2 jackstands, crappy jack and minimal tools!) and FieroJoe (and his dad) for painting my spoiler.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P8060001.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P8060006.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P8060007.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P8060004.jpg"> <P>(sorry for large image sizes...I dont have a program to trim them down!  I will get one soon!)<P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">            <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo||||reg||14
